    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: [25-1229-00 Rev A, 25-1229-100 received 14/04/2025 25-1229-105 Rev F, Design & Access Statement received 10/06/2025].\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.",
